values ('faking-water-caustics', true, $post${"id":"faking-water-caustics","published":true,"date":"2026-10-04","readingMinutes":2,"tags":["Unity","Shaders","Water","Caustics"],"thumb":"/assets/blog/faking-water-caustics/water-result.png","links":{"linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7512537707798044672/"},"i18n":{"en":{"title":"Faking caustic highlights for water","kicker":"Work in progress","displayDate":"October 4, 2026","summary":"A Unity water shader experiment: projecting world-space normals through a plane and using that projection to sample a caustics texture with triplanar mapping."},"es":{"title":"Simulando reflejos cáusticos en el agua","kicker":"Trabajo en progreso","displayDate":"4 de octubre de 2026","summary":"Un experimento con un shader de agua en Unity: proyectar las normales en espacio global a trav?s de un plano y usar esa proyecci?n para muestrear una textura de c?usticas con mapeado triplanar."}},"story":{"en":{"eyebrow":"Work in progress","blocks":[{"type":"lead","text":"I'm learning how to fake caustic highlights for water in Unity. This is a work in progress, exploring how to create the effect in a shader."},{"type":"figure","src":"/assets/blog/faking-water-caustics/water-result.png","alt":"Unity water shader experiment in a basin, with caustic highlights visible beneath the surface.","caption":"The current water shader test, with the caustic pattern visible beneath the surface."},{"type":"chapter","number":"01","eyebrow":"Current approach","title":"Projecting normals through a plane"},{"type":"p","text":"The approach I'm learning uses world-space normals projected through a plane, sort of like a visor. I use that to calculate a triplanar projection in which to sample the caustics texture."},{"type":"figure","src":"/assets/blog/faking-water-caustics/shader-graph.png","alt":"Overview of the Unity Shader Graph used for the water and caustics experiment.","caption":"An overview of the shader graph behind the experiment. Open the image to inspect the full graph."},{"type":"chapter","number":"02","eyebrow":"Next step","title":"From faking the effect to simulating it"},{"type":"p","text":"For now, I'm learning to fake the effect by sampling a caustics texture. I want to learn how to simulate caustics, though. That's the next direction I want to explore."}]},"es":{"eyebrow":"Trabajo en progreso","blocks":[{"type":"lead","text":"Estoy aprendiendo a simular visualmente los reflejos c?usticos del agua en Unity. Es un trabajo en progreso en el que exploro c?mo crear el efecto con un shader."},{"type":"figure","src":"/assets/blog/faking-water-caustics/water-result.png","alt":"Experimento de shader de agua en Unity en una cubeta, con reflejos c?usticos visibles bajo la superficie.","caption":"La prueba actual del shader de agua, con el patr?n de c?usticas visible bajo la superficie."},{"type":"chapter","number":"01","eyebrow":"Enfoque actual","title":"Proyectar normales a trav?s de un plano"},{"type":"p","text":"El enfoque que estoy aprendiendo consiste en proyectar las normales en espacio global a trav?s de un plano, como una especie de visor. A partir de eso calculo una proyecci?n triplanar con la que muestrear la textura de c?usticas."},{"type":"figure","src":"/assets/blog/faking-water-caustics/shader-graph.png","alt":"Vista general del Shader Graph de Unity utilizado para el experimento de agua y c?usticas.","caption":"Vista general del grafo del shader del experimento. Abre la imagen para inspeccionar el grafo completo."},{"type":"chapter","number":"02","eyebrow":"Siguiente paso","title":"De imitar el efecto a simularlo"},{"type":"p","text":"Por ahora estoy aprendiendo a imitar el efecto muestreando una textura de c?usticas. Aun as?, quiero aprender a simularlas. Esa es la siguiente direcci?n que me gustar?a explorar."}]}}}$post$::jsonb)
